    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Plugin improve user experience with your online shop. Users can share they cart with others by sending a unique link. It also can be post at some popular social networks. It works only on non blocks cart page.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload plugin to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce Settings page in main menu</li>\n<li>Switch on Sharable Cart tab</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20can%20i%20configure%20a%20plugin%3F'>\nHow can i configure a plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can set expire period, text on a button and button location.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='why%20button%20is%20not%20shown%20on%20cart%20page%3F'>\nWhy button is not shown on cart page?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This plugin works only on non-block version on WooCommerce cart page.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>First version of plugin. You are able to manage sharable carts and use it on cart page.</p>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<p>Changed a button style</p>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<p>Fix bug of getting a cart object</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;?php code(); // goes in backticks ?&gt;\n</code></pre>\n"
    },
